ale plan.',\r\n     *     },\r\n     *   ],\r\n     *   sessionId: 'support-thread-TCK-1234',\r\n     * });\r\n     * ```\r\n     */\r\n    add(body: MemoryAddParams, options?: RequestOptions): APIPromise<MemoryAddResponse>;\r\n}\r\n"]
